---
import "./series-visual.css";
---

<figure class="task-overview series-visual not-prose">
  <div
    class="flowchart"
    role="img"
    aria-label="基本执行流程：接收任务并加入历史，调用模型，记录模型回复。如果模型请求调用工具，就执行工具，将执行结果或错误加入历史，再次调用模型；如果没有工具请求，就显示回答并结束本次运行。"
  >
    <div class="node start forward" style="--row: 1">
      <strong>接收任务</strong><span>加入消息历史</span>
    </div>
    <div class="node model forward" style="--row: 2">
      <strong>调用模型</strong><span>携带历史与工具说明</span>
    </div>
    <div class="node forward" style="--row: 3">
      <strong>记录模型回复</strong>
    </div>
    <div class="node decision forward" style="--row: 4">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <polygon points="1,50 50,1 99,50 50,99"></polygon>
      </svg>
      <strong>模型请求<br />调用工具？</strong>
      <span class="yes">是</span>
    </div>
    <div class="node tool forward" style="--row: 5">
      <strong>执行工具</strong>
    </div>
    <div class="node result" style="--row: 6">
      <strong>将执行结果或错误<br />加入消息历史</strong>
    </div>
    <div class="node finish" style="--row: 7">
      <strong>显示回答</strong><span>结束本次运行</span>
    </div>
    <div class="exit-route"><span>否</span></div>
    <div class="return-route"><span>带着结果再次调用</span></div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    基本流程示意。工具结果加入历史后，沿右侧箭头回到“调用模型”；没有工具请求时，沿左侧箭头结束运行。
  </figcaption>
  <p class="flow-note">
    用户中断、达到轮数上限或模型请求失败也可能结束运行，01
    章再展开这些情况。运行结束后，仍需检查修改和测试结果，判断任务是否完成。
  </p>
</figure>

<style>
  .task-overview {
    margin: 1.7rem 0;
    color: var(--series-ink);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    container-type: inline-size;
  }
  .flowchart {
    --node-height: 76px;
    --arrow: var(--series-blue);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2.5rem minmax(0, 23rem) 2.5rem;
    grid-template-rows: repeat(7, var(--node-height));
    row-gap: 28px;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--series-rule);
    border-radius: 0.6rem;
    background: var(--series-canvas);
  }
  .node {
    position: relative;
    grid-column: 2;
    grid-row: var(--row);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.15rem;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 0.4rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--series-secondary);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--series-paper);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .node strong {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .node > span {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--series-secondary);
  }
  .start,
  .finish {
    border-radius: 2rem;
  }
  .model {
    border-color: var(--series-blue);
    background: var(--series-blue-wash);
  }
  .tool,
  .result {
    border-color: var(--series-feedback);
  }
  .forward::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 100%;
    left: 50%;
    width: 2px;
    height: 28px;
    background: var(--arrow);
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }
  .forward::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 1;
    top: calc(100% + 21px);
    left: 50%;
    border-left: 5px solid transparent;
    border-right: 5px solid transparent;
    border-top: 7px solid var(--arrow);
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }
  .decision {
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 0;
    background: none;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .decision svg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }
  .decision polygon {
    fill: var(--series-blue-wash);
    stroke: var(--series-blue);
    stroke-width: 1;
    vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;
  }
  .decision strong {
    position: relative;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .decision .yes {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 2;
    top: calc(100% + 2px);
    left: calc(50% + 9px);
    color: var(--series-blue);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .exit-route,
  .return-route {
    position: relative;
    margin-block: calc(var(--node-height) / 2);
    border-block: 2px solid var(--arrow);
    color: var(--arrow);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .exit-route {
    grid-column: 1;
    grid-row: 4 / 8;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--arrow);
  }
  .exit-route span {
    position: absolute;
    top: -1.6rem;
    left: 0.5rem;
  }
  .return-route {
    grid-column: 3;
    grid-row: 2 / 7;
    border-right: 2px solid var(--arrow);
  }
  .return-route span {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    right: -0.6rem;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    padding-block: 0.6rem;
    background: var(--series-canvas);
  }
  .exit-route::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    right: -1px;
    bottom: -6px;
    border-block: 5px solid transparent;
    border-left: 7px solid var(--arrow);
  }
  .return-route::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: -1px;
    top: -6px;
    border-block: 5px solid transparent;
    border-right: 7px solid var(--arrow);
  }
  figcaption,
  .flow-note {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--series-secondary);
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }
  .flow-note {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
  }
  @container (max-width: 420px) {
    .flowchart {
      grid-template-columns: 1.75rem minmax(0, 1fr) 1.75rem;
      padding-inline: 0.75rem;
    }
    .node strong {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }
    .node > span {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
    }
  }
</style>
